        <li><strong>Direct Errata Inbox:</strong> Send error reports, typo flags, or alternative solution suggestions to <a href="mailto:support@clipsat.org" style="color:var(--indigo); font-weight:600">support@clipsat.org</a>.</li>
        <li><strong>Review Turnaround:</strong> Reported errata are typically reviewed within 24 to 48 hours by our educator team.</li>
        <li><strong>Public Changelog:</strong> Major curriculum revisions, feature releases, and content updates are documented in our public <a href="/changelog.html" style="color:var(--indigo); text-decoration:underline">Changelog</a>.</li>
      </ul>
